From: vadik likholetov <vadikas@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dce: build the dce-probe-test module alongside tegra-dce

dce-probe-test.c is carried as a plain source file under
../sources/drivers/platform/tegra/dce/ (spliced in by dce-virt-common's
default.nix), not as an addition in this diff, so it can be read and
reviewed as code rather than as a patch.

Add it as its own obj-m target so it links against the EXPORT_SYMBOL'd
DCE client IPC API (tegra_dce_register_ipc_client() and friends) without
being folded into tegra-dce-objs. The dce/Makefile's existing ccflags-y
already resolves the public dce-client-ipc.h include, so no extra -I is
needed.
---
diff --git a/drivers/platform/tegra/dce/Makefile b/drivers/platform/tegra/dce/Makefile
--- a/drivers/platform/tegra/dce/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/platform/tegra/dce/Makefile
@@ -33,3 +33,5 @@
 	dce-admin-debug.o \
 	dce-debug-perf.o
 endif
+
+obj-m += dce-probe-test.o
